  concept: 'Authored objective: Repair crystal, SPI and reset failures.

    Authored
    requirement: Demonstrate three electrical faults, repair their physical sites
    and qualify a new full epoch after each.

    General teaching principle: Communication
    links require compatible endpoints, timing, signal integrity and the authored
    link tests.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this
    objective is complete.'
  analogy: Two speakers must agree on a language and timing, not merely share a cable.
